00:04:55.700 --> 00:04:57.560
You take Remley.

00:04:57.560 --> 00:05:00.000
His guitar playing is getting worse every time.

00:05:01.120 --> 00:05:03.370
- Well, Jack, it's really not Frankie's fault.

00:05:03.370 --> 00:05:05.050
About three weeks ago, he burned his hand

00:05:05.050 --> 00:05:07.160
