00:05:47.190 --> 00:05:51.000
Well, certainly, I'll be very, very happy to.

00:05:51.000 --> 00:05:52.110
To Helene.

00:05:52.110 --> 00:05:53.770
Perfect.

00:05:53.770 --> 00:05:55.070
All righty.

00:05:55.070 --> 00:05:57.790
You know, I'm from Waukegan, too.

00:05:57.790 --> 00:05:59.600
