00:06:04.500 --> 00:06:07.360
We're all so proud of you in Waukegan.

00:06:08.040 --> 00:06:13.690
Well, I know practically everyone in Waukegan, yet I don't seem to remember you.

00:06:14.010 --> 00:06:15.070
Well, no.

00:06:15.610 --> 00:06:17.880
